@startuml
' Readability layout by Vincent with Codex assistance (#393); existing model/feature credit retained.
!include style.puml
!pragma layout smetana

skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam classFontSize 16
skinparam noteFontSize 15
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam arrowThickness 1.1
skinparam arrowColor MODEL_COLOR
skinparam classBackgroundColor MODEL_COLOR

    class PonHubDataState

    class Student

    class Lesson

    class Attendance

PonHubDataState "0..*" --> "0..*" Attendance : ordered records
Attendance "0..*" --> "1" Student : studentId (PersonId)
Attendance "0..*" --> "1" Lesson : lessonId (LessonId)

note as AttendanceNotes
  Attendance notes:
  • Unique key: Student ID
    + Lesson ID + LocalDate.
  • Dated history is separate
    from current membership.
  • Retained after a Student
    is unenrolled from a Lesson.
end note

@enduml
